# Large regeneratable inputs: a jane::marketdata::FileSink recording of a
# synthetic or replayed session (see jane::replay::SyntheticOrderGenerator /
# ReplayEngine, and apps/bookview for the same idea applied to book-state
# snapshots instead of raw messages). Reproducible from a seed, don't version.
data/recordings/*.bin
data/recordings/*.jsonl

# artifacts/*.json (benchmark results) and artifacts/*.html (the book
# animation) are intentionally NOT ignored: they're the receipts behind
# docs/benchmarks.md and a required deliverable, not build output.

# Unrelated local plugin state
ruvector.db

